SUMMARY:Yoga and Sound Immersion (Davis)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260530T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260530T170000
UID:2757458fc0fc28bd300c65b60cd76404@events.yolocountylibrary.org
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a 45 min Vinyasa yoga class followed by a 45min So
 und Immersion (Sound Bath) session that will leave you feeling refreshed a
 nd grounded. Yoga will help you ease into the practice and find clam. The 
 sound immersion combines breathwork\, light stretching\, and a sound bath 
 with crystal singing bowls\, chimes\, bells\, wave drum\, and rain sticks.
 \n\nAll levels welcome. Please dress comfortably and bring a yoga mat or s
 omething comfortable to lie on.
LOCATION:Blanchard Room\, Mary L Stephens Davis Branch Library
URL:https://events.yolocountylibrary.org/event/15983594
X-SOURCE:Yolo Library
END:VEVENT
