SUMMARY:The Art of TheArthur Wright (Exhibit is June 1 - July 31)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260601T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260601T235959
UID:fb1fd17f98e9afe26740e9275c8a1a60@events.yolocountylibrary.org
DESCRIPTION:Bay Area artist TheArthur Wright will have his art on display 
 in the Blanchard Room of the Stephens-Davis Library throughout June and Ju
 ly. Wright uses the unique process of bleaching his art to make what he ca
 lls golden bleach paintings. His art can be found in the UN Building in Sa
 n Francisco\, in colleges and galleries around the world\, and was feature
 d in an Oprah Winfrey sponsored art show in Chicago. \n\n His art can be 
 viewed during the library’s open hours.\n\nJoin us for a talk with TheAr
 thur Wright on Sunday\, June 21 at 2pm. \n\nFor more information on TheAr
 thur Wright\, visit his site:  thearthurwright.net
LOCATION:Mary L Stephens Davis Branch Library
URL:https://events.yolocountylibrary.org/event/16917731
X-SOURCE:Yolo Library
END:VEVENT
